      "updated": 1794489459418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Listen      👂         🎧 🔊 🎵 🎙️\nWatch       👀        👁️ 📺 🎥 🔭\n\n\nQuery       🔍        🔎 ❓ 💬 🧐\n\nCreate      ✨        🆕 🎨 🪄 🛠️ 🏗️ 🧩 💡 ⚒️\nRead        📖        📚 📄 📰 📜 📖 📑 📃 📋 \nUpdate     📝    🔄 🔁 ♻️  ⬆️\nDelete      🗑️                 ❌ 🚮 ⛔ 💥\n\nEdit         ✏️\n\n\nGet         📥 ⬇️ 📩 🤲 🎁\nPut         📤 ⬆️ 📦 🫳 \n\n\nAdd         ➕ 🟢 ✚ 📎 🧩\nRemove     🗑️\nTake        🤲 ✋ 🫴 📥 🛍️\nNew         ✨ 🆕 🌟 🎉 🌱\nConstruct   🏗️ 🔨 🧱 🛠️ ⚒️\nDestruct    💥 🧨 🔨 🪓 🗑️",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Listen      👂         🎧 🔊 🎵 🎙️\nWatch       👀        👁️ 📺 🎥 🔭\n\n\nQuery       🔍        🔎 ❓ 💬 🧐\n\nCreate      ✨        🆕 🎨 🪄 🛠️ 🏗️ 🧩 💡 ⚒️\nRead        📖        📚 📄 📰 📜 📖 📑 📃 📋 \nUpdate     📝    🔄 🔁 ♻️  ⬆️\nDelete      🗑️                 ❌ 🚮 ⛔ 💥\n\nEdit         ✏️\n\n\nGet         📥 ⬇️ 📩 🤲 🎁\nPut         📤 ⬆️ 📦 🫳 \n\n\nAdd         ➕ 🟢 ✚ 📎 🧩\nRemove     🗑️\nTake        🤲 ✋ 🫴 📥 🛍️\nNew         ✨ 🆕 🌟 🎉 🌱\nConstruct   🏗️ 🔨 🧱 🛠️ ⚒️\nDestruct    💥 🧨 🔨 🪓 🗑️",
      "autoResize": true,
